msgid "Light Shield"
msgstr "Light Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/light-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Light Shield gives the OpenMV Cam nine high-power white LEDs driven by a"
" TPS61169 LED driver, with brightness controllable from the camera over PWM."
msgstr ""
"Light Shield memberikan OpenMV Cam sembilan LED putih berdaya tinggi yang "
"digerakkan oleh driver LED TPS61169, dengan kecerahan yang dapat dikontrol "
"dari kamera melalui PWM."

